  "metadata": {
    "alignment": "unspecified",
    "description": "Executable Pending single-DGX-Spark session-replay job for OpenMOSS MOSS-VL-Realtime. An ordered session.json drives the checkpoint's native realtime session while it remains active, including bounded timestamped frames, aligned or interrupting prompts, raw proactive-silence control tokens, and later correction chunks. The result contains a replay MP4 plus the authoritative JSONL transcript sidecar; this recipe does not expose the upstream interactive WebSocket, camera, or screen-capture service.",
